  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-banner.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-body0.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/shots/voxy-hero.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-h1.png\" alt=\"МАЛЕНЬКИЕ ПЛИТКИ\" width=\"263\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-body1.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/shots/voxy-s1.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-h2.png\" alt=\"SABLE\" width=\"133\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-body2.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/shots/voxy-s2.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-h3.png\" alt=\"ПРОСТЫЕ ОБЛАКА\" width=\"299\" height=\"50\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-body3.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/shots/voxy-s3.png\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fJa2Cbmrne4\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_badges/discord.png\" alt=\"Присоединяйтесь к Discord\" width=\"166\" height=\"46\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/falling-colud/make-it-compatible-voxy\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_badges/github.png\" alt=\"Исходный код на GitHub\" width=\"164\" height=\"46\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-hmic.png\" alt=\"Сделайте это совместимым\" width=\"365\" height=\"46\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sable-make-it-compatible\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_mic/sable-icon.png\" alt=\"Сделайте это совместимым: Sable\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-portals-make-it-compatible\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_mic/mic-ip-icon.png\" alt=\"Сделайте это совместимым: Immersive Portals\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/voxy-hrel.png\" alt=\"Связанные проекты\" width=\"338\" height=\"46\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/falling-colud/voxy-forged\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/rel/voxy-rel-voxy.png\" alt=\"Voxy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/littletiles\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/rel/voxy-rel-littletiles.png\" alt=\"LittleTiles\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsable\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/rel/voxy-rel-sable.png\" alt=\"Sable\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simple-clouds\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/make-it-compatible-voxy/rel/voxy-rel-simpleclouds.png\" alt=\"Simple Clouds\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>Этот мод можно использовать совместно только с Voxy — другие моды не являются обязательными зависимостями. Свободно для использования в модпаках.</em></p>",
